  "description": "# ✨  JOIN TEA PARTY ✨   \n                       \n#### Looking for an active and chill clan?                   \n#### Grow Stronger • Fight Together • Win Raids                   \n#### “Sip tea. Slay bosses.” \n\n### ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n### ✅ MEMBER REQUIREMENTS   \n### ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n##### 🔹 Everyone is welcome — new or experienced players!       \n##### 🔹 Combat level 40+ — let’s grow as a team      \n##### 🔹 Stay active — 2+ days of inactivity without notice = kick            \n##### 🔹 Join raids — at least once every three raids           \n##### 🔹 Be respectful — good vibes only         \n##### 🔹 Daily challenges — must be completed!\n\n### ━━━━━━━━━━\n\n### 🕒 RAID SCHEDULE\n\n### ━━━━━━━━━━\n\n##### 📅 Daily at 14:00 UTC+1        \n##### ⚔️ Organized raids as tokens are gathered      \n##### 🎯 Maximize loot &amp; XP together!        \n\n### ━━━━━━━━━━━━━    \n### 💬 DISCORD (coming soon)  \n### ━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n##### 🛠️ Launching in a few days        \n##### 📢 Stay updated &amp; coordinate raids       \n##### 🏆 Teamwork = better rewards         \n\n#\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n#\n\n#### Ready to join Tea Party?         \n#### Let’s dominate idleMMO together!        \n#### If u want to join write Talavera15 (discord) or wave leader",
